# Patterns are relative to the REPO ROOT: that is the build context (see Dockerfile).
#
# BuildKit prefers <dockerfile>.dockerignore over <context>/.dockerignore, so the
# file it actually reads is Dockerfile.dockerignore next to this one. Keep the two
# identical; this copy is the one a context of apps/api would use.

.git
.github
.devcontainer
.vscode
docs
infra
certs

**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/dist
**/build
**/generated
**/.next
**/out
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/*.tsbuildinfo

**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log

**/Dockerfile
**/Dockerfile.dockerignore
**/.dockerignore
compose*.yml
Makefile
**/*.md
**/.DS_Store
